        "description": "Wixar StudioVR revolutionizes immersive learning with its 360° content gamification authoring tool. It allows designers to create directly while immersed in 360° environments, adding 3D environments and objects for enhanced realism thanks to its unique Spatial Content Creation Tool.\nThe platform features:\nAn intuitive user interface for quick mastery\nA spatialized creation mode for authentic VR design\nReal-time preview functionality\nCollaborative capabilities for simultaneous multi-user projects\nPowered by AI, Wixar accelerates scenario creation and generates 360° images, streamlining production. This AI integration enables rapid content development without compromising quality.\nIdeal for creating amazing Immersive training, Serious Games, interactive Virtual Tours, job discovery experiences, or new employee onboarding, Wixar StudioVR lets you configure immersive educational experiences in just minutes.\nBy harnessing AI and VR, Wixar StudioVR boosts creativity and efficiency in content creation, allowing you to design and customize your VR experiences by adding playful interactions to your 360° photos and videos, as well as integrating 3D environments and objects for a truly immersive experience.\n",
